## Schedule list load & caching

Schedule bootstrap:
- `src/Bible.Alarm/Services/Bootstrap/ScheduleBootstrapService.cs`

Key behaviors:
- avoids reloading from DB if schedules already exist in state
- loads a language dictionary in parallel (used for display name lookups)
- loads schedules from the Schedule DB via `IAlarmScheduleService`
- populates display names via `ScheduleStatePopulator`

Note:
- The app no longer persists a `ScheduleList` disk cache. Home renders from Fluxor state populated from DB.

